# Hub API: the database is built from hub/data/reference/seed/ (first request or image build).
# The seed is processed Deutsche Börse data: it must not be published (this repo is public).
# scripts/sync-hub.sh copies it locally; copy it to the server by hand (scp/rsync), never via git.
hub/data/reference/seed/
# events.csv holds tagesschau.de headlines, which may not be republished; the API reads events from the seed.
hub/data/reference/events.csv
hub/data/hub.duckdb*
hub/data/*.seeding
hub/.env

